      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2017-2020\n\nMigrate to Vitess\n\n~8 engineers, 3 yrs.\nVTGate resolves the\nshard at query time,\nso resharding is an\noperation, not a\ncode rewrite.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2017-2020\n\nMigrate to Vitess\n\n~8 engineers, 3 yrs.\nVTGate resolves the\nshard at query time,\nso resharding is an\noperation, not a\ncode rewrite.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
